<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Carrig in talks, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Carrig in talks, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carrig Diamonds Ltd on Tuesday advised that negotiations were taking place which could affect its share price.</p>
<p>Carrig urged shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
